  "description": "There are laws around the world that are hard to believe.\n\n\"There's no way that law exists!\"\n\"Actually, that sounds like it could be real...\"\nThis quiz will test your common sense and intuition.\n\nThis game is a true-or-false quiz based on unique laws that actually exist (or once existed) in countries around the world.\n\nFrom laws that make you laugh out loud to ones that are surprisingly reasonable, you'll face quiz questions about the world's most unusual laws.\n\nHow to play is simple.\n・Read the law\n・Choose True or False by intuition\n・Understand instantly with results and explanations\n\nEven when you're right, you'll be surprised: \"That's really a law?!\"\nEven when you're wrong, you'll enjoy it: \"That law actually exists?!\"\n\nPlay from just one question at a time.\nPerfect for passing time or finding fun conversation topics.\n\nCan your common sense handle the world's laws?\n\nThe game supports both button controls and touch controls, allowing you to play in TV mode, handheld mode, or tabletop mode.\n※This game is designed to be played on the Nintendo Switch™ in vertical orientation.",
